<title>USA: G7 calls on IMF to seek accord on SDR by H.K. meet.</title>
<headline>G7 calls on IMF to seek accord on SDR by H.K. meet.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1997-06-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Group of Seven called on the International Monetary Fund to provide for an &quot;equity&quot; allocation of Special Drawing Rights and to work towards completing agreement by the time of the World bank/IMF meetings in September in Hong Kong.</p>
<p>The call came in the economic statement issued during the G7 summit here.</p>
</text>
